    "rawText": "[Song Title: Channels of Light]\r\n[Style: electro, breakbeat, clean studio recording, conversational male vocal]\r\n[Caption: Systems hum until color speaks.]\r\n[Image: RGB bars dissolving into motion.]\r\n[Refresh Title: R to the G to the B]\r\n[Theme: System & Process]\r\n[Gradients: 3]\r\n[Rank: 27]\r\n[Title Rarity: 1.70]\r\n[Seeds: 88304, A:41, B:6, C:199, D:72]\r\n[Perspective: system_voice → we_community]\r\n[Concept: Simple rules, vivid results.]\r\n[Topic: System & Process → rules_as_music]\r\n[Genre Bias: electro → breakbeat]\r\n[Style Change: Reset]\r\n[Modulation: none]\r\n[Hook Prominence: high]\r\n[Deviation: crisp contrast]\r\n[Created: February 10, 2026 at 9:30 PM]\r\n[Composer Version: v2.6]\r\n\r\n[Intro]\r\n[Glitch clicks, metronomic synth, no vocals]\r\n\r\n[Fragment A]\r\n[Dry drum machine, mono bass]\r\nRed sets the baseline  \r\nGreen finds the groove  \r\nBlue holds the ceiling  \r\nThat’s how we move  \r\n\r\n[Reset]\r\n[Tempo hiccup, filter sweep]\r\nR to the G to the B  \r\n\r\n[Fragment B]\r\n[Beat widens, syncopated hats]\r\nEvery rule hums softly  \r\nTill it’s played just right  \r\nNumbers turn to feeling  \r\nSignals turn to light  \r\n\r\n[Bridge]\r\n[Breakdown bridge, vocals closer]\r\nWe don’t need the noise loud  \r\nWe just tune the frame  \r\nSmall decisions repeating  \r\nNever twice the same  \r\n\r\n[Final Chorus]\r\n[Full beat return, call-and-response backing]\r\nR to the G to the B  \r\nWatch the pattern breathe  \r\nSimple lines in motion  \r\nShow us what we see  \r\n\r\n[Ending]\r\n[Strip to pulse and echo]\r\nR to the G to the B\r\n",
